{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41450","headline":"新竹 · 李建勳","name":"新竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嫋嫋薰风软，娟娟湛露光。\n参差仙子仗，迤逦羽林枪。\n迥去侵花地，斜来破藓墙。\n箨乾犹抱翠，粉腻若涂装。\n迳曲茎难数，阴疎叶未长。\n嬾嫌吟客倚，甘畏夏虫伤。\n映水如争立，当轩自着行。\n北庭尊酒兴，还爲此君狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}